 # Changelog
 
+## 0.4.0
+- Racks: define racks with shelves and slots, drag bottles into place (mouse or touch), swap, take out, auto-fill, search, "Find in rack"
+- Opening a bottle from a rack frees its slot; placements never exceed the bottle count
+- Stats page: region, country, vintage, style, grape, producer, drink-by years, price bands, gains and losses, bottles opened per month
+- Import / export: CSV download (re-importable, includes rack positions as text) and a full JSON copy
